          "comment": "Maybe the handicapper has caught up on the evidence of his latest C&D fourth; needs more",
          "spotlight": "Won three on the spin (6f-7f) here in the spring, all when Jack Doughty was still claiming 3lb, and went up 9lb in the weights; possible the handicapper has caught up now on the evidence of his latest C&D fourth a month ago and needs more.",
