              "quote": "That's three out of three at the track for Time Patrol. He's a lovely horse and we've had a lot of fun with him, so we're very pleased. We'll get him home and make a plan but there's no doubt he will be back down to Brighton at some stage during the year - Tony Carroll, trainer."
