              "quote": "He had a couple of runs at the Curragh for Ger Lyons and didn't show much. He joined us at the back end and, although I have yet to get his head in front, he's showing some ability. Unfortunately he had been a bit coltish, so we've gelded him and he seems much better. I think that should bring out plenty of improvement from him. It's hard to know what his trip is, but he doesn't jump out as a sprinter and is more likely to run over a mile next. 22-03-23"
