          "comment": "String of consistent efforts for his in-form yard; no obvious reason he won't go well",
          "spotlight": "Wins have come on the AW and is 0-13 on turf (better treated on grass); string of consistent efforts latterly for his in-form yard and there's no obvious reason he won't go well again.",
