          "comment": "Each-way possibilities provided she's as effective back on turf and back at 1m",
          "spotlight": "Generally progressive, mostly in handicaps, over 9.5f-1m2f on AW since last September; ran creditably in Newcastle Group 3 most recently, taking overall form figures to 32341111233; each-way possibilities if proving as effective back on turf and back at 1m.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-01-18",
              "horse": "Charlotte's Web",
              "horse_id": "5982517",
              "race": "BetMGM Winter Oaks Fillies' Handicap (GBBPLUS Race)",
              "race_id": "884517",
              "course": "Lingfield (AW)",
              "course_id": "crs_10218",
              "distance_f": "10",
              "distance_y": "2200",
              "quote": "Jack [Mitchell gave Charlotte's Web a great ride from where she was drawn and she was relaxed in front. It's great that we've now won it three times and the plan now is for her to go to All Weather finals day at Newcastle - Simon Crisford, joint-trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-12-04",
              "horse": "Charlotte's Web",
              "horse_id": "5982517",
              "race": "BetMGM Winter Oaks Trial Fillies' Handicap",
              "race_id": "881434",
              "course": "Lingfield (AW)",
              "course_id": "crs_10218",
              "distance_f": "10",
              "distance_y": "2200",
              "quote": "It was another step forward for Charlotte's Web and we're very much looking forward to seeing her back for the Winter Oaks. It's too early to compare her to our previous winners because she's still improving. I hope there's more to come from her, and there will need to be to win next time, but I couldn't be more pleased with her attitude and how she finished her race. Her jockey gave her a very nice ride - Simon Crisford, joint-trainer."
            }
          ],
