          "comment": "Ran well in Royal Ascot handicap last time but this looks a much stiffer task",
          "spotlight": "Career-best form the last twice, winning at Leicester then running well off a mark of 83 in Royal Ascot handicap, both over 1m; faces a much stiffer task at the weights upped to Listed level.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-06-18",
              "horse": "Cheshire Dancer",
              "horse_id": "5237864",
              "race": "Kensington Palace Stakes (Fillies' Handicap)",
              "race_id": "896130",
              "course": "Ascot",
              "course_id": "crs_52",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1760",
              "quote": "Brilliant run from the filly. Cheshire Dancer has been tried over a mile and a quarter, and dropped back to a mile. She had a good run today, she seems to enjoy this track and ground - David Probert, jockey."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "horse": "Cheshire Dancer",
              "horse_id": "5237864",
              "quote": "The plan last year was to try to get her into the Sandringham, which we failed to do, as she went to Kempton and ran the only bad race of her life. This year the plan would be to head to the Kensington Palace Stakes, so she'll probably have one run before she goes there. She's a good-looking filly with a lovely pedigree, so I'd be hopeful we can get some black type with her. 09-04-25"
            },
            {
              "horse": "Cheshire Dancer",
              "horse_id": "5237864",
              "quote": "This lovely filly, who runs in the colours of the Manor House Stables Syndicate, made a great start to her career last weekend at Haydock when she was third over 7f. She showed her inexperience at the start when ducking out to the right but warmed to her task as the race went on and finished well. She should be a little more streetwise next time. 17-08-23"
            }
          ],
