          "comment": "On a long losing sequence but holds a fighting chance off current mark",
          "spotlight": "Landed the Wokingham in 2021 and 2022; on a long losing sequence but ran encouragingly in big field at Newbury most recently; fighting chance off current mark.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2023-10-06",
              "horse": "Rohaan",
              "horse_id": "3247360",
              "race": "Ascot Iron Stand Handicap",
              "race_id": "848643",
              "course": "Ascot",
              "course_id": "crs_52",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "It's great to get Rohaan back. I was under a bit of pressure today because I told his owners he was on his way back and they've come over from Ireland, so it's great. He's a horse of a lifetime for me and he'll come back here for the Group 1 on Champions Day. He finished fourth last year so we might as well have a go - David Evans, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2022-10-01",
              "horse": "Rohaan",
              "horse_id": "3247360",
              "race": "John Guest Racing Bengough Stakes (Group 3)",
              "race_id": "820615",
              "course": "Ascot",
              "course_id": "crs_52",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Rohaan loves Ascot and loves cut in the ground and I hope he'll come back for Champions Day - Adam Kirby, rider."
            },
            {
              "date": "2022-06-18",
              "horse": "Rohaan",
              "horse_id": "3247360",
              "race": "Wokingham Stakes (Heritage Handicap)",
              "race_id": "811479",
              "course": "Ascot",
              "course_id": "crs_52",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Rohaan fell on the gallops and we thought his career was over. He bombed out at York but David got him back to his best. This horse was done in March but he has just won on the bridle - Chris Kelly, joint-owner."
            },
            {
              "date": "2021-06-19",
              "horse": "Rohaan",
              "horse_id": "3247360",
              "race": "Wokingham Stakes (Heritage Handicap)",
              "race_id": "783970",
              "course": "Ascot",
              "course_id": "crs_52",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Rohaan is a serious horse, but now he's being taken seriously. He's so easy to train and it's great having a nice horse. I was confident, but you never know what the draw is going to do and where the action will be. It wasn't the ideal race for him, but it's worked out well - David Evans, trainer.  It took Rohaan a while to warm up and get going and I was a little bit worried initially but the further he went the better he was and he won well in the end - Shane Kelly, jockey."
            },
            {
              "date": "2021-05-22",
              "horse": "Rohaan",
              "horse_id": "3247360",
              "race": "Casumo Bet10Get10 Sandy Lane Stakes (Group 2)",
              "race_id": "782853",
              "course": "Haydock",
              "course_id": "crs_598",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "I don't know why Rohaan was such a big price as the form was there. He's a class horse but nobody seems to realise it, though, and he goes on any ground. As a gelding he's not qualified for the Commonwealth Cup. He'll get a penalty for the Wokingham and there's the Jersey over seven furlongs, but I don't really know. - David Evans, trainer"
            },
            {
              "date": "2021-04-28",
              "horse": "Rohaan",
              "horse_id": "3247360",
              "race": "Qipco British Champions Series horseracinghof.com Pavilion Stakes (Commonwealth Cup Trial) (Group 3)",
              "race_id": "781326",
              "course": "Ascot",
              "course_id": "crs_52",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Rohaan is a nice horse and Dave has done very well with him. I think a level track helps him. He's been in great form all year and has a super attitude. He's a very honest horse with a good turn of foot. Fair play to Dave and the owners for putting him in here and they got their just rewards - Ryan Moore, jockey."
            },
            {
              "date": "2021-03-10",
              "horse": "Rohaan",
              "horse_id": "3247360",
              "race": "Ladbrokes Watch Racing Online For Free Handicap",
              "race_id": "777766",
              "course": "Lingfield (AW)",
              "course_id": "crs_10218",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1321",
              "quote": "Rohaan has done well to win from his draw but I got a nice tow into the race and he finished off well in the straight - Ryan Moore, jockey."
            },
            {
              "date": "2020-12-22",
              "horse": "Rohaan",
              "horse_id": "3247360",
              "race": "Get Your Ladbrokes Daily Odds Boost Nursery Handicap",
              "race_id": "772864",
              "course": "Lingfield (AW)",
              "course_id": "crs_10218",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1321",
              "quote": "I was at the sales and had a look at Rohaan because I trained his half-brother Dougan. He's got size and scope and you can't fault him really. I've heard he had wind issues but I haven't found a problem and he's now won on three different tracks, one straight and stiff, one right handed and now one left handed. I'm pretty sure he'll go on improving for a while, and I think he'll be fine on grass, but I'm going to take it steady - David Evans, trainer."
            }
          ],
