          "comment": "Well-held third last time; allowed to dominate when winning time before at Ludlow",
          "spotlight": "Exploited much reduced mark when making all at Ludlow (3m, good to soft) but then finished a well-held third at Stratford (2m6f, good); much could depend on whether he's allowed to dominate.",
