          "comment": "Back to last winning mark but unreliable and can appear to be a hard ride",
          "spotlight": "Repelled an in-form opponent at Hereford (3m1f, good to soft; front pair clear) in November and now back to the same mark after three lesser efforts, the latest in new cheekpieces; can look a hard ride.",
