          "comment": "Has stamina to prove over this far but he's compiled a solid record for this yard",
          "spotlight": "Has stamina to prove over this far but he's compiled a solid record for this yard and it was a Class 2 he contested last time at Market Rasen (beaten under 5l).",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-04-24",
              "horse": "Prince Imperial",
              "horse_id": "2394522",
              "race": "Hazelton Mountford Insurance Brokers Handicap Hurdle",
              "race_id": "891741",
              "course": "Warwick",
              "course_id": "crs_2210",
              "distance_f": "19",
              "distance_y": "4180",
              "quote": "Prince Imperial won well and he's just improved and improved. He stays very well and he's got that bit of confidence back again. He'll improve again for a step up in trip and might win a nice staying race during the summer on a sound surface - Olly Murphy, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2022-10-26",
              "horse": "Prince Imperial",
              "horse_id": "2394522",
              "race": "Bet At racingtv.com Handicap",
              "race_id": "822776",
              "course": "Nottingham",
              "course_id": "crs_1040",
              "distance_f": "14",
              "distance_y": "3080",
              "quote": "Prince Imperial has had a light campaign, he's tough and wins on the all-weather so we'll keep him going through the winter. There'll be six runners in those two-mile races after Christmas so it makes sense to target them - Richard Hughes, trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "horse": "Prince Imperial",
              "horse_id": "2394522",
              "quote": "We bought him out of Sir Michael Stoute's yard last summer and he has done great since, winning at Bath in October, and last month he bolted up by six lengths at Chelmsford. We have learned that he is more effective going left-handed and we will give him one or two more runs and then save him for an all-weather campaign in the winter. There is a decent programme for him in 0-100 handicaps on artificial surfaces, and for a bargain buy - he only cost 50,000gns - I think we are going to have a lot of fun with him. 14-07-21"
            }
          ],
