              "quote": "I couldn't believe King Roly was backed so much. The way he was jumping over fences at home was electric. He was a bit sticky early on, but he warmed to it. I think he'll be a good chaser, he stays all day and will be the type for a summer national - Mickey Bowen, trainer,"
