          "comment": "8lb out of the weights when fourth (beaten 4.5l) at Worcester where he led over the last",
          "spotlight": "8lb out of the weights when fourth (beaten 4.5l) at Worcester where he led over the last; 1lb lower for this but he's a hard horse to predict.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-06-19",
              "horse": "Solid Fuel",
              "horse_id": "4239354",
              "race": "Get Best Odds Guaranteed @planetsportbet Handicap Chase",
              "race_id": "869086",
              "course": "Worcester",
              "course_id": "crs_2626",
              "distance_f": "16.5",
              "distance_y": "3630",
              "quote": "On the bare form many would be surprised. I've ridden Solid Fuel plenty now and we've been placed a couple of times. I've always liked him and thought he had enough ability to win. I rode him last week at Fontwell, where he wore a hood. I suggested wearing a red hood to post because, as he showed, he can be tricky in the prelims, but to then take it off for the race. He got into a good rhythm, jumped well, and we got a nice split turning in. He was tough from the last and saw it out well - James Best, jockey."
            }
          ],
