          "comment": "Probably needed recent Curragh comeback run; drops in class here",
          "spotlight": "Won handicaps over 1m4f at Cork and 1m5f at Ballinrobe last season; compounded quickly after being headed on seasonal return at the Curragh recently; drops in class here.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-07-22",
              "horse": "La Dame Blanche",
              "horse_id": "4274155",
              "race": "Follow @ Tote Racing On Twitter Handicap",
              "race_id": "873171",
              "course": "Ballinrobe",
              "course_id": "crs_4550",
              "distance_f": "13",
              "distance_y": "2818",
              "quote": "I was happy enough to slot in but then La Dame Blanche was fighting me so I let her go on. She wings around these tracks, once I got a fill into her down the back I was always confident I'd stay going. She didn't do a stroke at Ascot so we left the hood off and it worked - Ronan Whelan, jockey, speaking to Racing TV."
            }
          ],
