              "distance_f": "10",
              "distance_y": "2200",
              "quote": "Oriole is still learning a lot and she is lightly raced. It was a good opportunity for her to run well and we're scratching the surface and learning a bit about her at the same time. She showed a nice effort to quicken up and she could be anything. I think she will stay a mile and a half, but I don't think we'll need to go there yet - Rob Hornby, jockey."
