          "spotlight": "Dual Haydock Flat winner in the past; 0-9 over hurdles but has run well in defeat; poor effort at Sligo latest; others preferred.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2022-09-02",
              "horse": "Leitzel",
              "horse_id": "4481243",
              "race": "British Stallion Studs EBF Fillies' Novice Stakes (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "818665",
              "course": "Haydock",
              "course_id": "crs_598",
              "distance_f": "8",
              "distance_y": "1752",
              "quote": "The ground was probably tight enough for Leitzel today and she didn't travel around as well as she did the last day. She's still quite nervous and green and hopefully she's only going to go one way. It was a good performance and she could be a nice filly next year - Danny Tudhope, rider."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "horse": "Leitzel",
              "horse_id": "4481243",
              "quote": "She won her first two last year and then wasn't suited by the seven furlongs in the Rockfel. She'll stay a mile and a quarter and we'll start her back up in trip, possibly at York. 04-05-23"
            }
          ],
