          "comment": "Retains ability on the evidence of an eighth career win gained four starts ago",
          "spotlight": "Retains ability on the evidence of an eighth career win gained four starts ago in a race over this trip at Roscommon; has the merit of being a C&D winner.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2023-09-13",
              "horse": "Out On Friday",
              "horse_id": "2349890",
              "race": "Ardmore Handicap",
              "race_id": "849326",
              "course": "Tramore",
              "course_id": "crs_5200",
              "distance_f": "12",
              "distance_y": "2640",
              "quote": "Out On Friday was stepping back in trip, which suited him as all he does is stay. He loves to get his own way in front and can go on any ground - Sean Bowen, jockey, speaking on Racing TV"
            },
            {
              "date": "2022-08-10",
              "horse": "Out On Friday",
              "horse_id": "2349890",
              "race": "BOYLESPORTS Supporting Irish Racing Handicap",
              "race_id": "818968",
              "course": "Gowran Park",
              "course_id": "crs_4784",
              "distance_f": "9.5",
              "distance_y": "2080",
              "quote": "Out On Friday got a lovely ride from Killian. He has come back to form and you have to take the opportunities when you get them. There's a race at Galway next month which might suit him - Philip Byrne, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2020-07-28",
              "horse": "Out On Friday",
              "horse_id": "2349890",
              "race": "Caulfield Industrial Handicap (Div I)",
              "race_id": "763681",
              "course": "Galway",
              "course_id": "crs_4758",
              "distance_f": "8.5",
              "distance_y": "1883",
              "quote": "Out On Friday is a tricky ride and has his own ideas. He didn't like going left-handed at Leopardstown last week and loved going right-handed here. He's in again on Sunday and we might take our chance - Philip Byrne, trainer."
            }
          ],
