          "comment": "Not a bad run over hurdles last time following a moderate display on the Flat at Gowran",
          "spotlight": "Two wins hurdle, 2-15 on the Flat, both wins gained in the 2022 season; not a bad run over hurdles last time following a moderate display on the Flat at Gowran.",
