          "owner": "Liam Hackett",
          "owner_id": "own_387588",
          "prev_trainers": [],
          "prev_owners": [],
          "comment": "Won over hurdles last year, two of his five Flat wins came in quick succession in May 2023",
          "spotlight": "Won over hurdles last year two of his five Flat wins came in quick succession in May 2023; had only one run in this sphere last season.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-11-17",
              "horse": "Sequoiaspirit",
              "horse_id": "3168643",
              "race": "Bar One Racing \"Bet 10 Euros Get 50 Euros Sign Up Offer\" Tara Handicap Hurdle",
              "race_id": "881946",
              "course": "Navan",
              "course_id": "crs_5018",
              "distance_f": "22.5",
              "distance_y": "4940",
              "quote": "Sequoiaspirit is a cracking little horse. I was a bit worried about the step up in trip with the ground going, but he saw it out well. We always thought there was a nice race in him over hurdles, but it takes time to get to know him. Liam knows him well now. He's only a small horse and you would think that it would be mad going down the inside with him but he thrives on that sort of thing - Ray Hackett, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2021-07-14",
              "horse": "Sequoiaspirit",
              "horse_id": "3168643",
              "race": "Muckross Handicap",
              "race_id": "789348",
              "course": "Killarney",
              "course_id": "crs_4810",
              "distance_f": "11",
              "distance_y": "2455",
              "quote": "Sequoiaspirit is a fun little horse, is easy train, bounces out every morning and does whatever you ask him to do. I'll keep him on the Flat at the minute. He handles Dundalk so that is an option for the winter - Ray Hackett, trainer"
            },
            {
              "date": "2021-06-18",
              "horse": "Sequoiaspirit",
              "horse_id": "3168643",
              "race": "Patrickswell Apprentice Handicap (Div II)",
              "race_id": "787685",
              "course": "Limerick",
              "course_id": "crs_4888",
              "distance_f": "11.5",
              "distance_y": "2490",
              "quote": "Sequoiaspirit is a very handy horse but his heart is in the right place. I wouldn't be too anxious to put a big weight on him and he'll pitch away on the flat for a while - Ray Hackett, trainer."
            }
          ],
