          "prev_trainers": [],
          "prev_owners": [],
          "comment": "Getting on in years but showed plenty of spark over hurdles at Punchestown last month",
          "spotlight": "Useful and versatile staying type, winner of eight races including four on the Flat; getting on in years but showed plenty of spark when third over hurdles at Punchestown last month; stayed well when scoring on the Flat at Bellewstown last summer.",
          "medical": [],
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2022-10-01",
              "horse": "Walking On Glass",
              "horse_id": "2204204",
              "race": "Good Enuf 2 Eat Caterers At Gowran Park Handicap Hurdle",
              "race_id": "822503",
              "course": "Gowran Park",
              "course_id": "crs_4784",
              "distance_f": "24",
              "distance_y": "5280",
              "quote": "Walking On Glass is a right little horse, he's tough and he's honest. That's his seventh win and I'm delighted with him. He's in good order and as long as the ground is good we'll run away - Padraig Roche, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2020-06-23",
              "horse": "Walking On Glass",
              "horse_id": "2204204",
              "race": "Oristown Handicap (Div I)",
              "race_id": "760587",
              "course": "Navan",
              "course_id": "crs_5018",
              "distance_f": "13",
              "distance_y": "2860",
              "quote": "Walking On Glass is a right little horse. Since he won here last year, he's run 12 times and only been out of the first four on three of them. I think he's after improving since last year. He's tiny but he tries his heart out. He'l mix it for the summer - Padraig Roche, trainer"
            },
            {
              "date": "2019-08-20",
              "horse": "Walking On Glass",
              "horse_id": "2204204",
              "race": "BetVictor Guaranteed Run For Your Money Handicap Hurdle",
              "race_id": "738268",
              "course": "Sligo",
              "course_id": "crs_5122",
              "distance_f": "21",
              "distance_y": "4570",
              "quote": "Walking On Glass won well. Tramore didn't take anything out of him. He might go for a syndicates only handicap at Bellewstown next week - Padraig Roche, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2019-05-18",
              "horse": "Walking On Glass",
              "horse_id": "2204204",
              "race": "Troytown Bar Handicap",
              "race_id": "730920",
              "course": "Navan",
              "course_id": "crs_5018",
              "distance_f": "13",
              "distance_y": "2860",
              "quote": "He hasn't showed a lot in maidens but Padraig [Roche] does a good job and the step up in trip did him the world of good. The ease in the ground helped him as well. Where he goes from here is up to Padraig but he's a grand, small fun horse. He gave the boys their day out, which is what they wanted, and anything after that is a bonus. They'll enjoy him anyway whatever they get out of him - Gary Halpin, rider"
            }
          ],
