          "comment": "Two course wins during last year's excellent hurdling spell, big chance if fit after break",
          "spotlight": "Completed handicap four-timer last summer on decent ground, with two of those wins gained at this track; below best when ground eased afterwards; 0-10 on the Flat, ran only once in this sphere last season; progressed from 93 to 127 over hurdles last year; strong chance now off career-low Flat mark of 59.",
